msgid "Security Considerations"
msgstr "Pertimbangan Keamanan"

msgid "The following modules have specific security considerations:"
msgstr "Modul-modul berikut memiliki pertimbangan keamanan tertentu:"

msgid ""
":mod:`base64`: :ref:`base64 security considerations <base64-security>` "
"in :rfc:`4648`"
msgstr ""
":mod:`base64`: :ref:`pertimbangan keamanan base64 <base64-security>` "
"dalam :rfc:`4648`"

msgid ""
":mod:`hashlib`: :ref:`all constructors take a \"usedforsecurity\" keyword-"
"only argument disabling known insecure and blocked algorithms <hashlib-"
"usedforsecurity>`"
msgstr ""
":mod:`hashlib`: :ref:`semua konstruktor menerima argumen keyword-only "
"\"usedforsecurity\" yang menonaktifkan algoritma yang diketahui tidak aman "
"dan diblokir <hashlib-usedforsecurity>`"

msgid ""
":mod:`http.server` is not suitable for production use, only implementing "
"basic security checks. See the :ref:`security considerations <http.server-"
"security>`."
msgstr ""
":mod:`http.server` tidak cocok untuk digunakan di lingkungan produksi, dan "
"hanya mengimplementasikan pemeriksaan keamanan dasar. "
"Lihat :ref:`pertimbangan keamanan <http.server-security>`."

msgid ""
":mod:`logging`: :ref:`Logging configuration uses eval() <logging-eval-"
"security>`"
msgstr ""
":mod:`logging`: :ref:`Konfigurasi logging menggunakan eval() <logging-eval-"
"security>`"

msgid ""
":mod:`multiprocessing`: :ref:`Connection.recv() uses pickle <multiprocessing-"
"recv-pickle-security>`"
msgstr ""
":mod:`multiprocessing`: :ref:`Connection.recv() menggunakan pickle "
"<multiprocessing-recv-pickle-security>`"

msgid ":mod:`pickle`: :ref:`Restricting globals in pickle <pickle-restrict>`"
msgstr ":mod:`pickle`: :ref:`Membatasi global dalam pickle <pickle-restrict>`"

msgid ""
":mod:`random` shouldn't be used for security purposes, use :mod:`secrets` "
"instead"
msgstr ""
":mod:`random` sebaiknya tidak digunakan untuk keperluan keamanan, "
"gunakan :mod:`secrets` sebagai gantinya"

msgid ""
":mod:`shelve`: :ref:`shelve is based on pickle and thus unsuitable for "
"dealing with untrusted sources <shelve-security>`"
msgstr ""
":mod:`shelve`: :ref:`shelve berbasis pickle sehingga tidak cocok untuk "
"menangani sumber yang tidak tepercaya <shelve-security>`"

msgid ":mod:`ssl`: :ref:`SSL/TLS security considerations <ssl-security>`"
msgstr ":mod:`ssl`: :ref:`Pertimbangan keamanan SSL/TLS <ssl-security>`"

msgid ""
":mod:`subprocess`: :ref:`Subprocess security considerations <subprocess-"
"security>`"
msgstr ""
":mod:`subprocess`: :ref:`Pertimbangan keamanan Subprocess <subprocess-"
"security>`"

msgid ""
":mod:`tempfile`: :ref:`mktemp is deprecated due to vulnerability to race "
"conditions <tempfile-mktemp-deprecated>`"
msgstr ""
":mod:`tempfile`: :ref:`mktemp sudah usang karena rentan terhadap kondisi "
"balapan <tempfile-mktemp-deprecated>`"

msgid ":mod:`xml`: :ref:`XML security <xml-security>`"
msgstr ":mod:`xml`: :ref:`Keamanan XML <xml-security>`"

msgid ""
":mod:`zipfile`: :ref:`maliciously prepared .zip files can cause disk volume "
"exhaustion <zipfile-resources-limitations>`"
msgstr ""
":mod:`zipfile`: :ref:`berkas .zip yang disiapkan secara berbahaya dapat "
"menyebabkan kehabisan volume disk <zipfile-resources-limitations>`"

msgid ""
"The :option:`-I` command line option can be used to run Python in isolated "
"mode. When it cannot be used, the :option:`-P` option or "
"the :envvar:`PYTHONSAFEPATH` environment variable can be used to not prepend "
"a potentially unsafe path to :data:`sys.path` such as the current directory, "
"the script's directory or an empty string."
msgstr ""
"Opsi baris perintah :option:`-I` dapat digunakan untuk menjalankan Python "
"dalam mode terisolasi. Jika opsi tersebut tidak dapat digunakan, "
"opsi :option:`-P` atau variabel lingkungan :envvar:`PYTHONSAFEPATH` dapat "
"digunakan untuk tidak menambahkan path yang berpotensi tidak aman di "
"awal :data:`sys.path`, seperti direktori saat ini, direktori skrip, atau "
"string kosong."

msgid "security considerations"
msgstr "pertimbangan keamanan"
